   "displayName": "Patch 5",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-05-17T14:00:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The latest patch (Patch 5) for Star Wars Jedi: Survivor has arrived.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here are the fixes you can expect with this patch",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Improved content caching to reduce hitching.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved thread handling when raytracing is turned off.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for an issue where lowering the PC visual settings would incorrectly lower your resolution scale if FSR is disabled.: Note: if you previously disabled FSR and are playing on a lower visual quality, you may want to readjust your quality settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for a reset button not responding on PC when using both controller and keyboard.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "More robust detection of pre-order and deluxe content in-game, preventing players from only randomly having access to the content.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various performance fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stability improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various collision and navigation improvements to prevent issues where characters get stuck out of bounds.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where Drya Thornne would become invincible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Music fixes for scenarios where two different themes would collide.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where Bode wouldn’t grab the senator during some New Game+ playthroughs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for a bug where the Skriton wouldn’t appear correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for Dagan not appearing correctly in a cinematic.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some rare instances of players being unable to progress further in the game even after reloading.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for a bug where the Gorocco would disappear mid-combat.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for an issue where Cal would get stuck in a specific Blaster state if dying while in it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for a bug where BD-1 wouldn’t be able to open a door.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for void tear interactions not working correctly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for trying to load corrupt save games sometimes leaving you in the main menu. It will now correctly attempt to load your backup save.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved UX for Koboh matter turrets that players were previously unable to exit out of.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for the Rancor and the Wampa not correctly leaving Cal's XP behind when he respawns.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for a bug where the Skills menu wouldn't correctly close.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved sync for sound during one of the cinematics.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for the environment not loading correctly on Koboh after Cal respawns.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "More patches to come!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We’re still hard at work to improve your experience with Star Wars Jedi: Survivor. Please let us know if you run into any further issues and keep an eye out for future patches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
